ex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);\">Bio</span><div style=\"background:#2a2a2a;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 12px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#ffffff;min-height:20px;\">Seven years of clinical practice in anxiety, depression, and work-related stress. Sarah focuses on anxiety and work stress.</div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);\">Personal quote</span><div style=\"background:#2a2a2a;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 12px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#ffffff;min-height:20px;\">I meet people where they are and build from there.</div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);\">Licensed countries and states</span><div style=\"background:#2a2a2a;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 12px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#ffffff;min-height:20px;\">United States: New York, New Jersey</div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);\">Time zone</span><div style=\"background:#2a2a2a;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 12px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#ffffff;min-height:20px;\">Eastern Time (ET)</div></div></div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;margin-top:24px;\"><span></span><div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;\"><span style=\"background:#2a2a2a;color:#ffffff;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 16px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap;\">Reset to submitted</span><span style=\"background:#ffffff;color:#000000;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 16px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap;\">Approve profile</span></div></div></section></div></div></div><div style=\"position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(0,0,0,0.6)